{"4701910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Baby Peak", "steam_appid": 4701910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BABY PEAK: The Race for the Golden Pacifier is On!</strong><br>Are you ready for an unprecedented baby breakout? <strong>BABY PEAK</strong> is a chaos-fueled, competitive platform-racer where four players clash simultaneously. The goal is simple, yet reaching it is a true test of skill: grab the shimmering <strong>Golden Pacifier</strong> perched at the very top of the course!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this journey to the summit isn't just about jumping. You’ll need to utilize your entire arsenal of &quot;baby ammo&quot; to knock your friends out of the running!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701910/extras/912d1bb2416a25d503bf9c30d6adf31d.avif?t=1788344311\" width=1560 height=591 /></span><br><br><strong>CORE FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🍼 Milk Wars &amp; Bottle Tactics:</strong> Blast your rivals with milk from your baby bottle! Soak them to slow them down or time your shots perfectly to knock them off mid-jump. In this arena, strategic sabotage is more important than raw skill!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🏆 The Race for the Golden Pacifier:</strong> Embark on a vertical climb through punishing, vertically-designed platforms that get harder with every step. Watch out—one wrong move can send you tumbling back to the very start!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>💥 Chaotic Physics &amp; Comedy:</strong> Experience physics-based gameplay where every fall and collision leads to hilarious moments. Use the babies' clumsy movements to outmaneuver and manipulate your opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>👥 Online &amp; Local Multiplayer:</strong> Battle against up to 4 friends or show the world who the &quot;biggest baby&quot; is by competing against players globally.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚡ Fast-Paced Matches, Endless Fun:</strong> The action never stops with mechanics that are easy to pick up but incredibly difficult to master.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BABY PEAK: The Race for the Golden Pacifier is On!</strong><br>Are you ready for an unprecedented baby breakout? <strong>BABY PEAK</strong> is a chaos-fueled, competitive platform-racer where four players clash simultaneously. The goal is simple, yet reaching it is a true test of skill: grab the shimmering <strong>Golden Pacifier</strong> perched at the very top of the course!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this journey to the summit isn't just about jumping. You’ll need to utilize your entire arsenal of &quot;baby ammo&quot; to knock your friends out of the running!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701910/extras/912d1bb2416a25d503bf9c30d6adf31d.avif?t=1788344311\" width=1560 height=591 /></span><br><br><strong>CORE FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🍼 Milk Wars &amp; Bottle Tactics:</strong> Blast your rivals with milk from your baby bottle! Soak them to slow them down or time your shots perfectly to knock them off mid-jump. In this arena, strategic sabotage is more important than raw skill!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🏆 The Race for the Golden Pacifier:</strong> Embark on a vertical climb through punishing, vertically-designed platforms that get harder with every step. Watch out—one wrong move can send you tumbling back to the very start!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>💥 Chaotic Physics &amp; Comedy:</strong> Experience physics-based gameplay where every fall and collision leads to hilarious moments. Use the babies' clumsy movements to outmaneuver and manipulate your opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>👥 Online &amp; Local Multiplayer:</strong> Battle against up to 4 friends or show the world who the &quot;biggest baby&quot; is by competing against players globally.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚡ Fast-Paced Matches, Endless Fun:</strong> The action never stops with mechanics that are easy to pick up but incredibly difficult to master.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "BABY PEAK is a chaotic multiplayer platformer where four babies compete at the same time, blending reflexes and strategy. Your goal is simple: jump, climb, sabotage your opponents, and be the first to reach the golden pacifier at the top.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Bulgarian, Danish, Indonesian, Dutch, Finnish, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Polish, Hungarian, Norwegian, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Greek, Czech, Swedish, Albanian, Azerbaijani, Bosnian, Armenian, Croatian, Kazakh, Kyrgyz, Macedonian, Malay, Turkmen, Uyghur, Uzbek<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701910/3e6f35920c6eb1d0b1dec8328f9d6abec560c64e/header.jpg?t=1788344311", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701910/0f2238f08dd18c9099e947d02b056ba305c978ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788344311", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4701910/0f2238f08dd18c9099e947d02b056ba305c978ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788344311", "website": "http://www.analizgames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64 bits Windows<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2500K@3.